Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can see the stars tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that every star has a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That bright one is Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three lined up are Orion's Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Brr!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you cold?\NCome snuggle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And over there--that little cluster\Nof stars is Pleiades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and that one--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls! Dinner's almost ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.10,0:00:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,--Coming!\N--Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido... Shido? Shido, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori? Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro's happiness is rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, it'll soon be\Nhigh enough to seal her powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, we've got your back,\Nso just proceed with the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,--Got it.\N--What have you been mumbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...what did you have in mind\Nthat would make Muku happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Well, there're lots of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then show me all of them.\NLet's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... H-Hold up!\NYour hair's getting dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta do something about how\Nlong it is. Why not cut it and--?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to have it cut,\Neven if it's you asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I can't remember why,\Nbut I'm against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see. Sorry to ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, we can't leave it like that.\NAre you against tying it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just cutting it.\NWhat should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting some choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.84,OS,,0,0,0,,"1. Let a pro do her hair."\N"2. Have Shido tie it up."\N"3. Walk behind Mukuro, carrying it like a wedding dress train and nuzzling it tenderly."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choices, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:13.98,OS,,0,0,0,,"1. Let a pro do her hair."\N"2. Have Shido tie it up."\N"3. Walk behind Mukuro, carrying it like a wedding dress train and nuzzling it tenderly."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Walk behind Mukuro,\Ncarrying it like a wedding dress train
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and nuzzling it tenderly..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who picked that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Me! I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,MARIA, you come up\Nwith the choices, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Technically, I don't come up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're generated based on happiness level\Nand the date's progression.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wondered: Is there always\Na risky choice on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. There's typically a favorite,\Na contender, and a dark horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"A dark horse..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's using MARIA's computing power\Nto predict horse racing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:05:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do "two." Just tie it up for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna come to my house?\NWe've got combs and hair clips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. That sounds fun.\NMy hair is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, it's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good at this, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Kotori always makes me\Nhelp with her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl with me yesterday.\NShe's my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We should change your clothes.\NYou can borrow hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, this won't work.\NIt's way too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not like that. Can't you\Nreproduce it with Spirit power?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what you meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Why didn't you start with that?\NWhy'd you have her wear it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, shall we go, Mukuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right--\Ntoday was a fun day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really fond of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you'd do so much for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you love Muku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I do, and I wanna protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:07:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm fond of you, too!\NI love you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But... don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By vowing yourself to Muku,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you vow to stay away\Nfrom those other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I can't make a promise like that\N'cuz I wanna save all the Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I love the other Spirits I've sealed\Nas much as I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I hope you can\Nget along with them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.\NOkay, leave it to Muku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, farewell for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again soon, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good mor... ning...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!\NWhy are you in my house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, what are you\Ntalking about, Kot--?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost or I'll call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The things people do sleepwalking...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well. Guess I'll head to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Why the weird face, Tonomachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Sorry, who are you again?\NA transfer student?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've been at karaoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! There were so many people,\NI can't remember everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Tonomachi?\NIt's me, Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido... Itsuka? You guys know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamabuki, Hazakura, Fujibakama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?!\N--Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't you guys know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, is he hitting on us? So basic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't... know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Good morning, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka! Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The class is acting weird!\NWas Kotori not sleepwalking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I'm not following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't say that!\NLemme see your homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative. Do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaguya! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Baffled. Which class are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm coming. Delivery guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Are you a fan of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miku?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Random guys are calling me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Brr! Let's get shopping over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino! Natsumi! And Yoshinon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Yikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You guys know me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um... Sorry, what's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What the hell's going on?!\NDoesn't anyone know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's left? Reine, Kurumi,\Nthe Ratatoskr crew, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro...! If I'm right about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaleidoscope!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is Mukuro's doing,\NI can turn everything back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Segva.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might\Nfigure it out. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make everyone forget me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup! I locked their memories with Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Neat, right? This way,\Nwe can be all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can cherish Muku with all your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You love Muku, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, I met a strange guy at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew me and Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\NI met a weirdo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When I woke up, there was\Na stranger in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too. Some guy I don't know\Nwas calling me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:10.56,OS,,0,0,0,,"Call History"\N"Darling"\N"Darling" "Darling"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I immediately hung up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's in my call history! See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:12.56,OS,,0,0,0,,"Darling"\N"Darling"\N"Darling"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? "Darling"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember saving it! It's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuzuru. Could it be that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Recollect. We met him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\NI chased away a weird fan at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He looked really\Nworried about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My head started hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay? Need to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami! Hold on,\NI'll call Ratatoskr's medical team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.\NI'm sorry to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? O-Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you're Origami, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am, but I'm a different me than usual,\Nso it may surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nis what you're saying true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody remembers him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"Him"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Who? Do you know, Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative. I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. This must be Mukuro's doing.\NIn which case, what to do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold up. You're not making sense.\NWho's Mukuro? And who's "Him"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys should know. After all,\Nit was he, Shido Itsuka, who saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Shido Itsuka?\NThe same last name as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Now you, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So much fun! Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I am, Mukuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Good! Do you love Muku?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Muku, too! This is bliss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Loving and being loved by someone\Nis such a wonderful thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mukuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What is it, Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You said we were "close."\NWhat did you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how it feels.\NBut if I had to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,After you held Muku and we fell,\NI saw a strange dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:15:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dream"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream about a lonely,\Nyoung girl finding a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When Muku woke up,\NMuku wanted to see you for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That dream is--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you this world's Origami?!\NAfter Kurumi and I changed history?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup! Though it's weird saying,\N"Long time no see"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,considering the other me\Nhas been with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami! You remember who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! But the other me doesn't\Nsince her memories were locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused, but oh well.\NI'll just lock your memories again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No! If you manifest your Angel,\Nthey'll find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Find you"? Who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some extras here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph. No matter.\NI'll turn you all into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka! You're inverted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,--Nehemoth!\N--Begone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lataib.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you defy my attack.\NWhat's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.37,0:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my line. Your memories\Nshould be locked by Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you intend to get in Muku's way,\NI won't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?\N--You dare to interfere?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.93,0:18:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um... Please calm down and listen,\NMukuro... Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hmm?\N--Tohka? Referring to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Mukuro loves Itsuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,which is why she's upset\Nthat you came for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But the thing is,\NItsuka hates violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely, there's a better way\Nto win Itsuka's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A-And Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your goal?\NIt's not to fight Mukuro, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As if goals matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not rest until I purge\Nthe shame caused by this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As in, when you manifested\Nat DEM's base, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even if you beat Itsuka using force,\Ncan you truly say you beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Use not force, but heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you conquer his heart,\Ncan it be true victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do to win his love?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do to humiliate this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a way to do both\Nand determine a victor:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on a date, and the one\Nwho steals Itsuka's lips wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cuz it's best to be friends\Nbefore you kiss someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:20:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that! Why has Tohka inverted?\NAnd why--? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you whispering about?\NEat my damn strawberry already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies! Let's not cause a scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other masters here, so behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,--Who the hell are you?\N--What a weird outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're too rowdy,\Nyou'll trouble Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you magic words\Nto make Master hungry for cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Be tasty! Moe Moe Kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Now Master can't wait\Nto eat cake! Right, Master?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He... can't... wait... to... eat... cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:21:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right! Shido {\i1}loves{\i} cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Now then, enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... I learned something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Be tasty! Moe Moe Kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, feast like a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a vulgar woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kissing is reserved for\Nestablishing a relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What... doing? Stay out... way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:55.00,OS,,0,0,0,,"Episode 07:\N'Locked Memories.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.45,0:21:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro! Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A world crisis. Humanity is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can Shido save the world and Mukuro\Nagainst this planetary threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Key and Sword."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.98,OS,,0,0,0,,"Episode 08: 'Key and Sword.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mukuro arc concludes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
